  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Pacific Financial Inclusion Joint Programme responds to current and emerging challenges in the finance sector by playing a critical role in expanding inclusive financial services for rural and low-income women, men, youth, and micro-entrepreneurs. Results are achieved through performance-based grants for financial service providers, market research, and technical assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
